{
  "name": "dsh-paper-deepread",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "type": "module",
  "private": false,
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "HaoKuo",
  "description": "DSH-Paper-DeepRead is a DeepSeek Harness (dsh) web plugin that bundles the 文献精读库 Paper Deepread library and the paper-deepread-html deep-read skill: browse interactive paper reports in a sidebar panel, open the original PDFs, and let the model search the same catalogue. | DSH-Paper-DeepRead 是 DeepSeek Harness（dsh）Web 插件：内置「文献精读库」与 paper-deepread-html 精读技能，可在侧边栏浏览论文精读报告、打开原文 PDF，并让模型检索同一份书目。",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/HaoKuo/DSH-Paper-DeepRead.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/HaoKuo/DSH-Paper-DeepRead#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/HaoKuo/DSH-Paper-DeepRead/issues"
  },
  "icon": "./assets/icon.svg",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./assets/icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-session",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24",
    "dsh": "^0.2.0-rc.2 || ^0.2.1-rc.2 || ^0.2.1-rc.3"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "^0.2.0-rc.2 || ^0.2.1-rc.2 || ^0.2.1-rc.3"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "skills",
    "library",
    "assets",
    "docs",
    "locale",
    "README.md",
    "README.zh.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "RELEASE_NOTES.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "check": "node --check src/index.js && node --check src/library.js && node --check src/route.js && node --check src/skill.js && node --check lib/client.js",
    "pack": "bash scripts/pack.sh"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "paper",
    "deep-read",
    "literature",
    "文献精读",
    "skill",
    "web-ui"
  ]
}
